              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.50.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 1:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwumve, mwa moko yose mwe; tega amatwi nawe wa si, n’ibiri muri wewe vyose! Umwami Uhoraho n’abe icagiriza canyu, Umwami ari mu rusengero rwiwe rwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 26:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ehe rāba, Uhoraho ahagurutse ava i we, agira amanuke, atambagire ku mpinga z’imisozi yo mw isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.97.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 97:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imisozi izoshongera musi yiwe, n’imyonga isaduke, bibe nk’ishashara ir’ imbere y’umuriro, canke nk’amazi arindimuka ku gatembge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 28:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo vyose vyatewe n’igicumuro ca Yakobo, n’ivyaha vy’inzu ya Isirayeli. Non’ igicumuro ca Yakobo n’iki? Mbega s’i Samariya? Kand’ ibitabo vyatabge i Buyuda n’ibiki? S’i Yerusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 16:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma igisagara c’i Samariya nzogihindura nk’ikigūngūzi c’amabuye co mu ndimiro, habe aho gutera imizabibu; kand’ amabuye yaho nzoyahondoganiriza mu mwonga, n’amatanguriro y’amazu yaho nzoyaserura ahabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 2:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.8.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibishushanyo vyaho vyose bibajwe bizojanjagurwa bicike ubunywenywe, n’impēra zaho zose z’ivy’ isoni nke zizoturirwa n’umuriro, kand’ ibigirwamana vyaho vyose nzobihonnya; kuko habirundanije ar’ impēra z’ubumaraya, kandi bizosubira kuba impēra nyene za maraya wundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
